        "template--18377516024130__2997cda5-b08d-4c00-88ba-429d44d669e4-1679404905bfd973e8-1": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Americas Premier Clay Maker and Pottery Supplies. Moist clay manufacturing at Sheffield Pottery has set a new standard in the ceramic industry. Our Premium clay bodies are available screened and iron filtered. Stock formulas range from low-fire earthenware clay to the finest cone 10 stoneware and porcelain. We also make custom clay bodies and casting slips to your exact specifications using our state of the art facility.",
