          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Sheffield Pottery offers the nations most complete offerings to outfit and maintain any pottery and ceramics program, as well as knowledgeable support and service. We are an authorized distributor of all major brands of kilns, potters wheels, tools, safety equipment, studio furniture and glazes. We also manufacture our own premier line of clay bodies. We warehouse a massive inventory of ceramic art supplies, including dry materials ready to ship at all times.   To help you save money on ceramic and pottery art supplies, we offer special pricing for all schools and institutions including delivered pricing and free shipping deals.",
